Dependency and data scope

Chronal's original implementation and generated demonstration data are distributed under the MIT license. NumPy is installed separately under its BSD license; its installed distributions retain their complete licenses and notices. Python and development tools retain their own licenses.

No third-party market dataset, news archive, research paper text or model weight is bundled. Software licensing does not grant rights to market data, trademarks or provider services.

Diagram assets are original editable SVGs with generating code in `docs/figures` and `tools/`.
